on upgrades, and secrets that reward those who dare to dig deeper.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Soundtrack Straight from the 80s - A haunting mix of eerie ambiance and synth-driven retro tracks immerse you in the golden age of horror.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some places were meant to be forgotten. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some stories should never be told. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yet here you are, standing at the edge of something you can\u2019t explain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Past is watching, the darkness is always waiting!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Famous Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228940/header.jpg?t=1746551508","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228940/855753/743c6030b2e10b0b000cae8d0d7c340437337929/1750882913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742838878","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228940/855753/743c6030b2e10b0b000cae8d0d7c340437337929/1750882913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742838878","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228940/855753/743c6030b2e10b0b000cae8d0d7c340437337929/1750882913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742838878","id":257117354,"name":"Trailer #2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117354/cdb2816fbd45acea0bb2af29a4533100d335e83e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742838878"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228940/775623/d0a0c1843c2abc243bd124acbbb7f761537767f8/1750882911/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741099686"